    "detailed_description": "Dive into a vibrant, retro 3D adventure with Estellina, a fast-paced 3d platformer &amp; runner that will ignite your nostalgia for classic arcade games!<br><br>Embark on a journey through a colorful bright universe brimming with challenging scenarios. Solve puzzles on the fly and dodge treacherous obstacles as you race for the highest score and ultimate galactic glory.<br><br><strong>Features</strong>:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Thrilling On-the-Fly Puzzle Solving:</strong> Think fast and strategize your path through mind-bending puzzles that demand quick reflexes and razor-sharp wit.<br><br></li><li><strong>Score-Chasing Frenzy:</strong> Push your limits and rack up points as you maneuver through each level. Can you claim the title of the galaxy's greatest star?<br><br></li><li><strong>Reflex-Testing Obstacles:</strong> Dodge and weave through perilous hazards that will put your dexterity to the ultimate test. Stay focused and avoid collisions at all costs!</li></ul>",
